\pard\b\fs20 Year 0: The Announcement\b0\par
\fs16\par
For centuries our tribe has lived here in these holy caves, warmed by the blood of our Mother Earth. But whoever leaves the cave and its surroundings faces the merciless world of the north. Cold, hunger and disease await.\par
Yet here in the caves, one member of the tribe is unhappy. He sets off to ask the boss for a few days off, to recover and to visit the neighboring tribes.\par
